          "Condition": "PLAYER_HAS_ITEM Current (W){{ModId}}_{{Wand}}Wand, PLAYER_HAS_MAIL Current {{ModId}}_HogwartsValleyIncendio, PLAYER_HAS_MAIL Current {{ModId}}_HogwartsValleyFlooFlameRectangle, !PLAYER_HAS_MAIL Current {{ModId}}_HogwartsValleyFlooFlame",
